(((CommandLine = /* relay */i and CommandLine = /* -Domain */i and CommandLine = /* -ComputerName */i)) or ((CommandLine = /* krbscm */i and CommandLine = /* -sc */i)) or ((CommandLine = /* spawn */i and CommandLine = /* -d */i and CommandLine = /* -cn */i and CommandLine = /* -cp */i)) or ((ImageFileName = /.*\\KrbRelayUp.exe/i) or (OriginalFilename = "KrbRelayUp.exe")))
